SUMMARY:Wissahickon Loop Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this very diverse loop hike\, the next in our Wissahickon Wate
 rshed series\, and the first one fully within Philadelphia city limits.\nT
 his time\, we'll pick up with some of the trails where we left off last ti
 me\, but also cover a great deal of the trails within the Andorra Meadows 
 area\, which are quite beautiful.\nWe'll make our way south on the slopes 
 sometimes coming down to the creek\, and then the last five or so miles wi
 ll be on the Forbidden Drive coming back upstream\, and a bit uphill back 
 to Andorra where we started.\nDistance will be about 15 miles. If needed\,
  contact me at 908 343 8374
